WEBVTT

1
00:00:01,840 --> 00:00:03,760
The Huo family is really superior

2
00:00:04,120 --> 00:00:05,920
The life of ordinary people is like a grass sword

3
00:00:06,280 --> 00:00:16,350
a moment

4
00:00:16,710 --> 00:00:18,990
All lost

5
00:00:20,420 --> 00:00:22,220
There is no one more monster than the Huo family

6
00:00:23,100 --> 00:00:24,740
You want to cut off my hands and feet

7
00:00:25,260 --> 00:00:26,340
Like a phoenix

8
00:00:26,900 --> 00:00:35,250
Call the police? No need

9
00:00:35,530 --> 00:00:36,490
Someone will handle it

10
00:00:37,050 --> 00:00:43,230
If you dare to attack someone who specially raised your hand, the evidence is complete and the Huo family cannot escape.

11
00:00:43,590 --> 00:00:50,520
Can't they get up yet? They can get up when I leave. This is where it is.

12
00:00:50,520 --> 00:00:51,840
The place where the Huo family handles people

13
00:00:53,370 --> 00:00:54,930
This time, this place

14
00:00:55,330 --> 00:00:56,290
Probably no one will take the order

15
00:00:57,320 --> 00:00:59,240
We might have to tie up one of their cars

16
00:01:00,270 --> 00:01:06,160
What's wrong with the dormitory building being locked and no one taking orders?

17
00:01:07,030 --> 00:01:08,350
Let me slow down. My legs are a little weak.

18
00:01:08,550 --> 00:01:10,950
I just went to hell. I like guns.

19
00:01:11,110 --> 00:01:12,310
Doesn't mean I've actually hit someone

20
00:01:12,310 --> 00:01:14,360
How many days have you known me?

21
00:01:14,480 --> 00:01:15,560
More exciting than my 17 years

22
00:01:16,740 --> 00:01:20,600
How dare I catch up with you after we've only known each other for a few days?

23
00:01:20,600 --> 00:01:21,680
You are offending the Huo family
